WEBVTT

00:03:29.538 --> 00:03:30.873
but I had a state.

00:03:30.873 --> 00:03:32.833
The US government game me a voice

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:34.418
and asserted my human rights,

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:37.171
and that's what ultimately
led to my release

00:03:37.171 --> 00:03:38.339
10 days ago.

00:03:38.756 --> 00:03:44.553
(Applause)

00:03:44.887 --> 00:03:46.305
And on the day of my release,

00:03:46.347 --> 00:03:48.683
following a four-hour flight
from Kabul to Qatar,

00:03:48.683 --> 00:03:53.729
the euphoria I felt as I walked off
that plane is indescribable.

00:03:55.273 --> 00:03:57.441
But amidst the triumph
and joy of homecoming,

00:03:57.441 --> 00:03:59.068
something was amiss.

00:03:59.694 --> 00:04:02.655
On the day of my release,
I returned to society